 for thousands of years  and what makes a quilt is that you have  three layers you have a top you have an  insulating middle layer and you have a  back layer and to quilt you connect  these layers together usually with red  and this can be very decorative it's an  art form  and personally I got really excited  about making quilts as art and  particularly the modern quilting  movement oh before I say that I just  want to put this in R terms that  everyone can understand quilting it's  just fabric you cut up you sew together  and then you sew it together again okay  so back to Modern quilting  um this is an example of a beautiful  modern quilt it has these organic shapes  made out of fabric this one I also love  extremely different but it has this  beautiful composition that draws your  eye around the frame  quilts can also play with color like  this example which is really challenging  to do given that you don't have every  color in the rainbow available to you in  fabric  quotes can also have political messages  or quotes can be personal like this is a  self-portrait someone made in fabric  so I was really excited about this and  that brings me to the prerequisite the  prerequisite is that you are excited  about your work  um I don't think you need to be the most  experienced person  so I started quilting at the beginning  of 2021 I bought a sewing machine a  little over a year ago but I'm not going  to let that stop me doing something  interesting if I'm excited about it  so the first step in my creative process  is to come up with too many ideas I'm  somebody that I like to come up with one  idea and then execute the crap out of it  like don't keep thinking about other  things but my new method is that I try  to come up with more ideas than I think  I need I have an idea quota where I come  up with 10 ideas 40 ideas 50 ideas and  then from that you end up with new ideas  that you had never originally thought on  day one and also takes you in directions  that lets 